@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+{{#if stopped}}
+Stopped after repeated invalid tool calls continued despite recovery guidance. The rejected calls were not executed. The session remains available; the model was not changed.
+{{else}}
+<system-interrupt reason="tool_call_protocol_recovery">
+{{count}} tool calls in this request failed argument validation, including calls with different arguments.
+
+Your next call MUST use one advertised tool and its argument schema. Supply the required fields shown in the validation error. Put argument values directly in the tool's JSON object; omit transport envelopes and tool-protocol tags.
+
+Keep the explanation short. If the requested work is already complete, report its result instead of starting another check.
+</system-interrupt>
+{{/if}}
